<title>USA: CCC seeks commodities for Equatorial Guinea.</title>
<headline>CCC seeks commodities for Equatorial Guinea.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said it was tendering on April 23 for pinto beans, milled rice and vegetable oil for export to Equatorial Guinea.</p>
<p>It sought 120 tonnes of pinto beans, 60 tonnes of milled rice and 460 tonnes of vegetable oil. The beans and rice were for May 21-June 5 shipment with the oil slated for June 6-20.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
</text>
